      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SUE'S MEMORY (8) was an impressive winner last time, jumping from the same box to score by 6 lengths in a Grade 5 over 388m at Gosford. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. In form and can measure up again. ZIPPING SINNER (7) has shown good improvement at his last two starts, hitting the frame latest when 2nd at Taree Super Track over 300m. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. Leading chance. KEY JASPER (6) doesn't have the best strike-rate but recent form is sound. Has hit the frame the last two runs, the latest when second (17.50) at Taree Super Track. Has good speed so she should be prominent despite the draw. Expected to be in this for a long way. REBORN HARMONY (4) should be thereabouts despite an unplaced run here most recently.",
